      "status": "PROVISIONALLY_RESOLVED_PENDING_APPLY",
      "mechanical_change_block_ids": null
    },
    {
      "roadmap_item_id": "REV-R3-2",
      "reviewer_comment": "The three prospective controls have no named fail-closed outputs.",
      "author_response": "We assigned CONTROL_LABEL_DEPENDENCE_STOP, CONTROL_REPRESENTATIVE_INVARIANCE_STOP, and CONTROL_CODOMAIN_COMPARABILITY_STOP to the three requested failure/noncomparability cases, retained each diagnostic and prohibited inference, and state that no control or stop has been observed.",
